chapter.v:
	Now the 

	 names of the twelve apostles are these: first, Simon, who is called Peter, and Andrew his brother; James the son of Zebedee, and John his brother;
 [Ex. 20:12; Deut. 5:16]

	But when 

	 they deliver you up, do not worry about how or what you should speak. Forit will be given to you in that hour what you should speak;
 [Acts 4:29; Col. 4:3]
